{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50357","headline":"敦煌廿咏（并序） 十、李庙咏 · 敦煌人作品[一]","name":"敦煌廿咏（并序） 十、李庙咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔时[二二]兴圣帝，遗庙在敦煌。\n叱咤雄千古，英威静一方。\n牧童歌塚上，狐兔穴坟傍。\n晋史传韬略，留名播五凉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"敦煌人作品[一]","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50357.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50357","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}